# TODO — Real-Time Fraud Detection (RTA_PP)

## 0. Zrobione

Fundament projektu:
- [x] Silnik generowania danych (`data_generator/`)
- [x] Wspólne schematy pól Kafka (`data_generator/schemas.py`)
- [x] Eksport datasetu offline (`data_generator/export_datasets.py`)
- [x] Infrastruktura Kafka w Docker Compose (`rta_kafka`, KRaft, port 9092)
- [x] Kafka UI (`rta_kafka_ui`, port 8080)
- [x] JupyterLab (`rta_jupyter`, port 8888, token `rta`)
- [x] Połączenie generator → Kafka (`transactions`, `app_events`)
- [x] Root `requirements.txt` dla generatora, notebooków i treningu ML

Dataset i modele offline:
- [x] Dataset treningowy 100k (`datasets/fraud_events_100k.csv`, `.jsonl`)
- [x] Notebook treningowy (`fraud_model_training.ipynb`)
- [x] Usunięcie leakage z treningu (`label`, `is_fraud`, `fraud_type`)
- [x] Porównanie modeli: Logistic Regression, Random Forest, XGBoost
- [x] Zapis modeli (`models/logistic_regression.joblib`, `models/xgboost.joblib`)

Wyniki ostatniego notebooka:
- [x] XGBoost: ROC AUC 0.9993, F1 0.9345
- [x] Logistic Regression: ROC AUC 0.9972, F1 0.8862
- [x] Random Forest: ROC AUC 0.9921, F1 0.7907

