## Uruchomienie (aktualny stan)

```bash
# 1. Start Kafka, Kafka UI i JupyterLab
docker compose up -d

# 2. Generator danych
python data_generator/generator.py --rate 10 --fraud 0.1

# 3. Eksport datasetu offline
python data_generator/export_datasets.py --rows 100000 --fraud 0.10
```

Interfejsy:

```text
Kafka UI:   http://localhost:8080
JupyterLab: http://localhost:8888  (token: rta)
```

Notebook treningowy:

```text
fraud_model_training.ipynb
```

Artefakty modeli:

```text
models/logistic_regression.joblib
models/xgboost.joblib
```
